{"5016110":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"COMPARTMENT 666 : ANOMALY EXPRESS","steam_appid":5016110,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every compartment hides a secret. Every decision brings you closer to the truth.<\/strong><br><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up aboard a mysterious train with no memory of how you got there. The only way forward is to carefully inspect each compartment and decide whether it is normal or affected by an anomaly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Observe your surroundings, trust your instincts, and don't overlook the smallest details. A missing suitcase, an unfamiliar silhouette, or a subtle change in the environment could mean the difference between survival and failure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But be careful...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not every anomaly remains still. <br> <br> <br><strong>FEATURES <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🚆 Explore a mysterious train inspired by the early 1900s. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/92196b32fa3ca538ff5ab21940cce619.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/92196b32fa3ca538ff5ab21940cce619.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/92196b32fa3ca538ff5ab21940cce619.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>👁️ Find and identify dozens of unique anomalies.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/df374201c7e94b2544c57c4c9402ac2e.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/df374201c7e94b2544c57c4c9402ac2e.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/df374201c7e94b2544c57c4c9402ac2e.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">📻 Use your limited radio device to detect hidden anomalies.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/31e63685f3765c41cc17ee69a73f2c3a.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/31e63685f3765c41cc17ee69a73f2c3a.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/31e63685f3765c41cc17ee69a73f2c3a.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">❤️ Three lives—every mistake brings you closer to death.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">💀 Multiple unique death sequences.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🔍 Increasing difficulty with easy, medium, and hard anomalies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🚪 Reach the final compartment and uncover the truth behind the journey.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/c736ac68beeeae8cc01d6c995ef17cd5.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/c736ac68beeeae8cc01d6c995ef17cd5.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/c736ac68beeeae8cc01d6c995ef17cd5.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><\/strong><br><br><strong>Will you reach the conductor... or become another passenger lost forever?<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every compartment hides a secret. Every decision brings you closer to the truth.<\/strong><br><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up aboard a mysterious train with no memory of how you got there. The only way forward is to carefully inspect each compartment and decide whether it is normal or affected by an anomaly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Observe your surroundings, trust your instincts, and don't overlook the smallest details. A missing suitcase, an unfamiliar silhouette, or a subtle change in the environment could mean the difference between survival and failure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But be careful...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not every anomaly remains still. <br> <br> <br><strong>FEATURES <\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">🚆 Explore a mysterious train inspired by the early 1900s. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/92196b32fa3ca538ff5ab21940cce619.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/92196b32fa3ca538ff5ab21940cce619.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/92196b32fa3ca538ff5ab21940cce619.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>👁️ Find and identify dozens of unique anomalies.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/df374201c7e94b2544c57c4c9402ac2e.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/df374201c7e94b2544c57c4c9402ac2e.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/df374201c7e94b2544c57c4c9402ac2e.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">📻 Use your limited radio device to detect hidden anomalies.<br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/31e63685f3765c41cc17ee69a73f2c3a.poster.avif?t=1793638782\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/31e63685f3765c41cc17ee69a73f2c3a.webm?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5016110\/extras\/31e63685f3765c41cc17ee69a73f2c3a.mp4?t=1793638782\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p><p class=\"bb_para